---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Contact"
  heading="Contact"
  description={`How to report a bug, request a new tool or ask a question about ${site.name}.`}
  path="/contact"
  lead="Bug reports and tool requests are very welcome."
>
  <h2>Report a problem or request a tool</h2>
  <p>
    Please open an issue on our public issue tracker: <a href={site.contactUrl} rel="noopener">{site.contactUrl.replace('https://', '')}</a>. Describe what you tried, which browser and device you used, and what happened.
  </p>
  <div class="callout">
    <p>
      <strong>Please do not attach private photos.</strong> Issues are public. If a specific file causes a problem, describe it (format, size, dimensions, where it came from) or share a file that contains nothing personal.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Before you write</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Questions about formats, limits and quality are answered on the <a href="/methodology">methodology page</a> and in the FAQ on each tool page.</li>
    <li>Questions about data: see the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>. In short, we never receive your files.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
